  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RP TROSA 2.0 -IUCN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN will work will focus on Meghna basin. The activities during the inception phase will focus on the revision and detailing of the Meghna proposal and budget for the TROSA phase II, which was developed earlier in consultation with the partners during Kathmandu workshop (August 2022) and follow up meetings and the same was submitted to Oxfam in November 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="4" type="90">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Int Union Conservation Nature</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN) is a membership Union uniquely composed of both government and civil society organisations. It provides public, private and non-governmental organisations with the knowledge and tools that enable human progress, economic development and nature conservation to take place together.</narrative>
  </participating-org>
